Hi,

I created new python bindings for libsensors called sensors.py which you
can find at:
https://github.com/paroj/sensors.py

the features are:
* Full access to low level libsensors3 API
* High level iterator API
* unicode handling
* Python2 and Python3 compatible

for a comparison with existing solutions see:
http://www.rojtberg.net/836/introducing-sensors-py/

